  <attributes uuid="a57ff72d-9335-4dd4-9394-b3d634f902a2">
    <name>PriorityOfPlacementIntoEmptyBins</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Put-away priority: empty bins first</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اولویت جای‌گذاری: ابتدا محل‌های خالی</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Priorità della disposizione nelle celle vuote</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Priorytet umieszczenia w wolnych komórkach</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Приоритет размещения в свободные ячейки</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Boş hücrelere yerleştirme önceliği</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Ưu tiên sắp xếp vào ô hàng trống</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>Number</types>
      <numberQualifiers>
        <precision>1</precision>
        <nonNegative>true</nonNegative>
      </numberQualifiers>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Workers should put items into empty bins first. The priority is considered when the application auto-generates intra-warehouse transfer tasks.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>کارکنان باید اقلام را ابتدا در محل‌های خالی قرار دهند. این اولویت هنگام ایجاد خودکار وظایف انتقال درون‌انباری توسط برنامه در نظر گرفته می‌شود.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Priorità della disposizione della merce nelle celle vuote. Viene utilizzato durante la creazione automatica dell'incarico della disposizione della merce.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Priorytet umieszczania towarów w wolnych komórkach. Używane w przypadku automatycznego tworzenia zadań związanych z umieszczaniem towarów.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Приоритет размещения товара в свободные ячейки. Используется при автоматическом создании заданий на размещение товаров.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Boş hücrelere ürün yerleştirme önceliği. Ürünleri yerleştirmek için otomatik olarak görevler oluştururken kullanılır.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Ưu tiên sắp xếp hàng hóa vào ô hàng tự do. Được sử dụng khi tự động tạo nhiệm vụ sắp xếp hàng hóa</value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:StringValue">
      <value>1</value>
    </minValue>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:StringValue">
      <value>4</value>
    </maxValue>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:NumberValue">
      <value>1</value>
    </fillValue>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
  </attributes>
  <attributes uuid="bc2c1446-8865-4601-93ff-6bbce4eba56a">
    <name>PriorityOfPlacementIntoSingleProductBins</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Put-away priority: mono-item bins first</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اولویت جای‌گذاری: ابتدا محل‌های تک‌قلمی</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Priorità della disposizione nelle celle mono merce</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Priorytet umieszczania w monotowarowe komórki</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Приоритет размещения в монотоварные ячейки</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Tek ürün özellikli hücrelere yerleştirme önceliği</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Ưu tiên sắp xếp vào ô hàng cùng loại</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>Number</types>
      <numberQualifiers>
        <precision>1</precision>
        <nonNegative>true</nonNegative>
      </numberQualifiers>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Workers should put items into bins that contain only the put-away item. The priority is considered when the application auto-generates intra-warehouse transfer tasks.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
